  "title": "Talen Energy Reports PJM Auction Results for the 2028/2029 Planning Year",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, July 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Talen Energy Corporation (“Talen,” “we,” or “our”) ( NASDAQ: TLN), a leading independent power producer, today reported its results from the PJM Base Residual Auction for the 2028/2029 planning year. Talen cleared a total of 10,180 megawatts at a clearing",
